{"seq":38,"slug":"isotonic-regression","title":"保序回归","stage":"DONE","category":"data-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression","rating":{"composite":4.04,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"保序回归-单调约束下的非参数拟合\">保序回归：单调约束下的非参数拟合</h1><p>有一类问题，我们对函数的形状几乎一无所知，却唯独确定一件事：它是单调的。剂量越高，反应越强；模型打分越高，真实为正的概率越大；广告出价越高，赢得曝光的机会越大。当唯一可靠的先验是「单调」而非某个具体的参数形式（线性、sigmoid、多项式）时，保序回归（isotonic regression）给出了在这一约束下的最优拟合：它不假设任何函数族，只要求输出随输入不减（或不增），并在此约束下最小化加权平方误差。</p>\n<p>保序回归的迷人之处在于，它同时是三件事：一个统计估计问题（单调约束下的非参数回归）、一个几何投影问题（把观测向量投影到单调锥这个凸集上），以及一个可以在线性时间内精确求解的算法问题（PAVA）。这三重身份贯穿整个 hub，也解释了它为什么在概率校准领域成为默认工具——校准函数天然单调，而我们又不愿对它的形状做过强假设。</p>\n<p>本 hub 由四条主线递进组织。<strong>基础</strong>（第一章）建立动机与数学骨架：为什么要用单调约束替代参数假设、如何把「保序」形式化为凸锥上的投影问题、以及保序回归在整个非参数与形状约束回归谱系中的位置。<strong>算法</strong>（第二章）深入求解机制：全序情形下线性时间的 PAVA、偏序与一般损失下的活集与网络流方法、以及复杂度和在线/流式更新。<strong>校准</strong>（第三章）是保序回归最重要的现代应用：把分类器的原始打分映射为可信概率，与 Platt/温度缩放正面对比，并用可靠性图诊断过拟合。<strong>实践</strong>（第四章）走向落地：多维保序的困难与近似、排序与剂量反应等经典应用、以及 scikit-learn 1.9 中的 API 细节、越界处理与生产陷阱。</p>\n<p>四条主线不是并列而是递进：没有第一章的凸投影视角，PAVA 的正确性只是一个技巧；没有算法这一层，校准中的过拟合与线性时间优势都无从谈起；而校准这一应用又反过来提出了新的问题——小样本过拟合、单调性的多维推广——把读者引向第四章。</p>\n<p><strong>本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界。</strong> 保序回归专注于「单调约束下的拟合」这一核心，刻意不展开几个相邻主题：序数变量的建模（有序类别的累积链接模型、阈值模型）属于兄弟 hub <a href=\"../ordinal-regression-methods/\">序数回归</a>，本 hub 只在需要单调一致性时引用它；条件分位数的估计与分位数交叉（同样涉及单调性修复）属于 <a href=\"../quantile-regression-methods/\">分位数回归</a>；覆盖率保证型的不确定性量化属于 <a href=\"../conformal-prediction-uncertainty/\">共形预测</a>，保序回归常作为其打分校准的一环出现，但两者的目标函数完全不同；而 PAVA 背后的凸优化与网络流理论，深挖在 <a href=\"../mathematical-optimization/\">数学优化</a>。遇到这些主题时，本 hub 一律「点到为止 + 跨库链接」，绝不重复展开。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐学习路径。</strong> 如果你是想快速用上校准的工程师，可以直接从第三章 <a href=\"calibration/probability-calibration\">概率校准</a> 入手，再回头补第二章的 <a href=\"algorithms/pava-algorithm\">PAVA</a> 理解其行为；如果你在意的是理论与算法，请按 1→2→3→4 顺序读，先建立 <a href=\"foundations/monotonic-constraint\">单调约束</a> 的凸投影视角；如果你的场景是多维单调（如信用评分、剂量-时间联合响应），读完基础后可跳到 <a href=\"practice/multidim-isotonic\">多维保序</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>前置知识。</strong> 阅读本 hub 需要：加权最小二乘与凸集投影的基本概念、二分类器输出与概率的区别、以及基础的算法复杂度分析（会看 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的区别）。不需要测度论，也不需要深度学习背景——校准部分会自足地介绍所需的最小概念。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础：从单调先验到凸锥投影","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-isotonic","title":"为何保序回归：当唯一可靠的先验是单调","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/foundations/why-isotonic"},{"seq":2,"slug":"monotonic-constraint","title":"单调约束：从加权最小二乘到凸锥投影","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/foundations/monotonic-constraint"},{"seq":3,"slug":"isotonic-taxonomy","title":"谱系：保序回归的变体地图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/foundations/isotonic-taxonomy"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"algorithms","title":"算法：如何在约束下高效求解","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/algorithms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pava-algorithm","title":"PAVA 算法：一次线性扫描解出保序回归","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/algorithms/pava-algorithm"},{"seq":2,"slug":"active-set","title":"活集方法：偏序与一般损失下的保序求解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/algorithms/active-set"},{"seq":3,"slug":"complexity","title":"复杂度与在线：从批量到流式的保序回归","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/algorithms/complexity"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"calibration","title":"校准：让打分变成可信的概率","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/calibration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"probability-calibration","title":"概率校准：让分类器的 0.9 真的是 90%","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/calibration/probability-calibration"},{"seq":2,"slug":"isotonic-vs-platt","title":"保序与 Platt 缩放：非参数 vs 参数化校准的抉择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/calibration/isotonic-vs-platt"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reliability-diagrams","title":"可靠性图与过拟合：诊断保序校准的成色","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/calibration/reliability-diagrams"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践：多维、应用与落地","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"multidim-isotonic","title":"多维保序：维度的诅咒与可行路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/practice/multidim-isotonic"},{"seq":2,"slug":"isotonic-applications","title":"应用：排序、剂量反应与 ROC 凸化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/practice/isotonic-applications"},{"seq":3,"slug":"isotonic-in-practice","title":"落地与边界：scikit-learn 里的保序回归工程手册","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/isotonic-regression/practice/isotonic-in-practice"}]}]}